  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Khao moo dang serves 4 and takes about 65 minutes including resting. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pork belly",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "pork-belly-skin-on"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is marinated in "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dark soy sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "soy-sauce-dark"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "light soy sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "soy-sauce-light"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "palm sugar",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "palm-sugar"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", then roasted until lacquered and dark red. A simple gravy is made from the resting juices."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rest the pork for 10 minutes before slicing. This lets the juices redistribute so the slices stay moist when they go on the rice."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
